{
  "_about": "PulseX CV, Swedish. Everything the program knows about the language is in this file: what work demands and how an ad or a CV shows it (prioritising), job titles and word endings (spelling), the sentences it offers and writes (suggestions), the questions to a local model, and the headings on the PDFs. Copy it to xx.json to add a language.",
  "_keys": "In every word list 'a|*b|c': a word must START a word in the text; *word may also stand inside one (the head of a compound: *lager finds 'centrallager'). Without the star 'teknik' is not found inside 'livsmedelsteknik'.",
  "language": "sv",
  "detect": [" och ", " att ", " är ", " för ", " med ", " som ", " på ", " till ", " vi ", " du "],

  "demands": [
    {"say": "noggrannhet",                       "shown_by": "noggran",                                                   "occupations": "*mekani|*kock|*montör|*kontrollant|laborat"},
    {"say": "högt tempo",                        "shown_by": "*tempo|tidspress",                                          "occupations": "*kock|*kök|restaurang|*servit|*kassa"},
    {"say": "fysiskt arbete",                    "shown_by": "fysisk|tunga lyft|lyfta",                                   "occupations": "*lager|*städ|*lokalvård|*bygg|*truck|*flytt|*arbetare|*vårdbiträde|*undersköt|*snickar"},
    {"say": "praktiskt arbete med händerna",     "shown_by": "praktisk|monter|*verkstad|reparer|händig",                  "occupations": "*mekani|*snickar|*montör|*svets|*elektriker|*kock|*bagar|*reparat"},
